		"Id": "chassisdef_shadowhawkiic_SHD-IIC-6",
		"Name": "Shadow Hawk IIC",
		"Details": "The Shadow Hawk IIC is an inexpensive second-line Clan BattleMech based upon the venerable Shadow Hawk design fielded by the Star League, although it weighs in at 45 tons instead of its progenitor's 55 tons. Introduced in the Clan's Golden Century, the Shadow Hawk IIC served with distinction for centuries to come in second-line and garrision clusters. The SHD-IIC-6 is a later model built with cutting edge modern technology, featuring a 270-rated XL fusion engine and Endo-Steel and Ferro-Fibrous construction materials for weight saving. It puts the free tonnage towards a highly distinctive loadout of 2 Medium Pulse Lasers, an ER Small Laser, a Small Pulse Laser, and the feature weapon, a Hyper-Assault Gauss/20 with three tons of ammo. 10 DHS cover heat needs and 6 jump jets provide extra lift.",
